WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.520
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:17.670
Last time: 47 = 4 tens + 7 ones

3
00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:24.530
Chapter 4 · Skip Counting & Sequences

4
00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:34.200
Count to 50 in just 10 jumps?

5
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:43.770
Meera's gullak: ten 5-rupee coins!

6
00:00:43.770 --> 00:01:00.000
One rupee at a time… so slow!

7
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:13.360
Kabir: 5, 10, 15, 20 … 50!

8
00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:20.950
How did Kabir count so fast? Think!

9
00:01:20.950 --> 00:01:32.240
He jumped by 5 each time. 10 jumps → 50!

10
00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:41.250
Skip counting: jump the same amount each time

11
00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:56.370
0 → 2 → 4 → 6 → 8 → 10

12
00:01:56.370 --> 00:02:04.340
Each jump = add the same number

13
00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:15.260
Pairs of chappals: 2, 4, 6, 8, 10, 12

14
00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:23.950
Counting by 2s → the even numbers!

15
00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:34.910
Count by 2s from 2 to 20. How many numbers?

16
00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:45.890
2, 4, 6 … 20 → that's 10 numbers!

17
00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:55.630
By 5s: 5, 10, 15, 20, 25 … 50

18
00:02:55.630 --> 00:03:05.680
By 5s, numbers end in 5 or 0

19
00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:16.860
Not said by 5s: 35, 42 or 45?

20
00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:24.290
42! It ends in 2, so we skip it

21
00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:42.320
By 10s: 10, 20, 30, 40, 50

22
00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:52.140
10, 20, ___, 40, 50. What's missing?

23
00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:58.090
30! 20 + 10 = 30

24
00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:08.270
Sequence: numbers in order, following a rule

25
00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:24.420
3, 6, 9, 12: each jump is 3

26
00:04:24.420 --> 00:04:33.490
Rule: add 3 → 15, 18, 21

27
00:04:33.490 --> 00:04:40.460
Kabir scores 4 runs every over

28
00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:50.740
4, 8, 12 … rule: add 4

29
00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:59.310
How many runs after 5 overs?

30
00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:10.830
16 after 4 overs, 20 after 5 overs!

31
00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:20.050
5, 10, 15, ___, ___, ___ ?

32
00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:25.150
20, 25, 30! Rule: add 5

33
00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:40.490
Which one is NOT counting by 5s?

34
00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:53.690
5, 10, 20, 40: the jumps change!

35
00:05:53.690 --> 00:06:01.560
A loop: the same step, again and again

36
00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:13.490
Start at 0 · Repeat: add 2, say it

37
00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:26.100
"Repeat add 2" is a loop!

38
00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:29.800
Your turn: practice check

39
00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:39.670
What is the rule for 5, 10, 15, 20?

40
00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:52.900
Add 5! Every jump is 5

41
00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:58.500
Skip counting = add the same amount

42
00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:00.700
The rule tells the next number

43
00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:04.100
Check the jump between numbers

44
00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:07.470
"Repeat add 2" is a loop

45
00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:14.740
Chapter 4 done!

46
00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:21.540
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
